#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-jae-jre-30.rst:5
#: a7d9ed233f6a42899e07545dd3a36783
msgid "JAE JRE-30 Radar"
msgstr "JAE JRE-30 雷达"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-jae-jre-30.rst:7
#: 281c3a4976fc4555b091516269f054b9
msgid ""
"The JAE (Japan Aviation Electronics Industry) JRE-30 radar is a light weight"
" (110g) radar with a maximum range of over 50m.  The relatively wide beam "
"width (about 20 deg) and reliable ranging even in difficult environments can"
" make it a better choice than lidar for some applications."
msgstr ""
"JAE（日本航空电子工业株式会社）JRE-30 雷达是一款轻量（110g）雷达，最大量程超过 50m。相对宽的波束宽度（约 20 "
"度）和在复杂环境下可靠的测距性能，使其在某些应用中比激光雷达更具优势。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-jae-jre-30.rst:9
#: 05473f60599c4be18df776dc53a09e52
msgid "The sensor supports both CAN and Serial interfaces."
msgstr "该传感器同时支持 CAN 和串口接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-jae-jre-30.rst:15
#: ededdfa6d4734f10886b098f4f3aa3e9
