#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-jae-jre-30.rst:17
#: b7d4596418b642239c30c7830b5dd44c
msgid ""
"The JAE JRE-30 radar can be purchased directly from `JAE "
"<https://www.jae.com/en/>`__.  Note that it is only certified for use in "
"Japan."
msgstr ""
"JAE JRE-30 雷达可直接从 `JAE <https://www.jae.com/en/>`__ 购买。请注意，它仅在日本经过认证使用。"

